Francisco, actually San Jose,

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.010
actually Cupertino but the plane...

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.060
I'll be there, and I am excited.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:21.300
Obviously any excuse to go
to the Steve Jobs Theater is,

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.360
I just, I will take it, I will go

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:25.090
because it is such a magical place.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.950
Especially just being
there with other people who

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.960
