00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.980
Not only I am super excited
about the announcements,

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.340
but it's really fun to get
to say hi to everybody.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.660
So Apple's invite for the 25th
was titled 'It's show time'

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.550
and obviously it's no secret
that Apple has been working

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.420
on a streaming service, working on shows.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:45.176
They're putting over a billion dollars

00:00:45.176 --> 00:00:49.070
into original content,
which is kind of insane

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.430
when you think about
how much money is going

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.430
into basically just making content

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:55.340
for us to be entertained to watch.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:57.310
Just stop and think
about that for a second.

00:00:57.310 --> 00:00:59.960
For our entertainment, a
billion dollars is going

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.660
into creating things for us to watch.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.520
Either way, I'm super excited about this

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:06.510
and honestly, I would do
anything to have a show

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:08.840
on whatever is this streaming platform.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.290
